5,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. Let's all try our best to find the werewolf and work together harmoniously.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! This is like a real adventure! I'm gonna find the bad guy first!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Me too! I bet I can spot the werewolf just by looking at them! Hehe.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shion,,Such enthusiasm. Let's see if that energy actually translates into useful logic.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,A spirited start indeed. I suggest we observe each other's reactions carefully before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Midori,,I agree with Benjamin. It's important to stay calm and listen to everyone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Boring! We should be playing a game of clues! @Shion, you're being too grumpy!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Sakura,,Maybe the werewolf is someone who acts too cool? Like... someone here?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shion,,"A baseless accusation already, Sakura? How predictable.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a bit early for accusations, though the psychological pressure can be an interesting tool.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Now, now, let's not fight. We are all on the same side, hopefully.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I wonder who the Seer is! They have a magic eye, right? That's so cool!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Sakura,,I want to know who the Seer is too! But I'll keep it a secret for now!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shion,,The Seer will likely stay quiet to avoid being targeted. Logic dictates they won't reveal themselves yet.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. The werewolf will also try to blend in. We must look for inconsistencies.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Midori,,I'll be watching everyone closely. Let's have a peaceful first night.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Rin,,I'm ready for the night! I hope nothing scary happens!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Sakura,,I'm not scared at all! I'm actually kind of excited!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
