31,1,1,talk,Midori,,Good morning. I have some very important information to share with you all.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Rin,,"What is it, Midori-san? Did you find a clue? Tell us, tell us!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, is it a secret? I love secrets!","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shion,,"If you're the Seer, Midori, now is the time to be precise.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. A timely revelation could save us a great deal of guesswork.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Midori,,"Yes... I am the Seer. I divined Sakura last night, and she is the werewolf.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Rin,,What?! Sakura-chan is the werewolf? No way! She's too funny!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! That's a lie! Midori-san, why are you being so mean? I'm just a girl!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shion,,"A direct hit on the first night. If Midori is the Seer, the game is practically over.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"A bold claim. Sakura, do you have a defense other than ""being a girl""?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm sorry, Sakura, but the divination was clear. I cannot lie about this.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Rin,,But maybe the Seer is lying? Maybe the werewolf is pretending to be the Seer!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Sakura,,Exactly! Rin is right! Midori-san is the scary one! I'm innocent!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shion,,Rin's attempt to defend Sakura is interesting. It's either naive or a calculated move by a Possessed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Shion makes a valid point. The synergy between Rin and Sakura is suddenly quite conspicuous.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Rin"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I understand it's shocking, but please trust me. We must act now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Rin,,I just don't want to vote for a friend! But if Midori-san is sure...,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Sakura,,Don't listen to her! She's trying to trick you all! Please!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shion,,The evidence provided by the Seer is the only concrete lead we have. I'm voting Sakura.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic dictates we follow the Seer's lead unless there is a compelling reason not to. I agree.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
